                                                "sense_id": "c3a63b1f-90f9-33d2-9787-1fa9b424a4ad",
                                                "text": "A group of seven close friends and lovers happened to be gay and writers with books either recently published or about to be published, and who lived in Manhattan, decided it might be fun and useful to have get-togethers to read work-in-progress to each other for feedback."
                                            }
